Package: mascot
Title: Live Mood-Driven Mascots for 'Shiny' Apps and 'Quarto' Sites
Version: 0.0.2.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Harsh", "Verma", email = "analyticswithharsh@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Adds a character drawn in code to 'Shiny' apps and 'Quarto'
    sites. The character shows a mood and animates when the mood changes,
    follows light and dark mode, and takes its colours from the theme. It
    works offline and uses no AI-generated images.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://insightsurge.github.io/mascot/, https://github.com/insightsurge/mascot
